# The journey on the docs site (docs/guide/journey.md). Rendered to journey.svg by go generate.
title: The journey from an idea to a measured release
direction: down
shape: 1. Shape the goal: grill goal
breakdown: 2. Break it down: slice, plan
ready: 3. Get a story Ready: grill story, ready
build: 4. Build it: build
prove: 5. Prove it: verify, inspect
ship: 6. Ship it: ship
release: 7. Release it: release
learn: 8. Measure and learn: measure, retro
explain: 9. Explain it: brief, tell
shape -> breakdown
breakdown -> ready
ready -> build: you say Ready
build -> prove
prove -> ship: you give the pass
ship -> release
release -> learn
learn -> explain
learn -> shape: the next goal
